><Positioned left="1066" top="710" width="474" height="22"><Container width="474" height="22" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#8A8172" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">口径尺寸需与压圈 CNC 程序一并复核，否则冬夏两地装配力差异会显现</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1040" top="739" width="18" height="18"><Container width="18" height="18" color="#C8552B" borderRadius="9.0"/></Positioned><Positioned left="1041" top="740" width="18" height="18"><Container width="18" height="18" alignment="CENTER"><Text fontSize="13" color="#F2EFE9" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">2</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1066" top="738" width="474" height="24"><Container width="474" height="24" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#3A3A38" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">密封圈实际装于筒身退刀槽，爆炸图置于尾盖之后</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1066" top="762" width="474" height="22"><Container width="474" height="22" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#8A8172" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">评审按装配顺序讲，不把序号当安装位置；顺序表已按实物排列</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1040" top="791" width="18" height="18"><Container width="18" height="18" color="#C8552B" borderRadius="9.0"/></Positioned><Positioned left="1041" top="792" width="18" height="18"><Container width="18" height="18" alignment="CENTER"><Text fontSize="13" color="#F2EFE9" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">3</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1066" top="790" width="474" height="24"><Container width="474" height="24" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#3A3A38" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">驱动板未画限流电阻位，需确认与 Ø28 内壁净空</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1066" top="814" width="474" height="22"><Container width="474" height="22" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#8A8172" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">如补件，Ø28 内径与板边间隙小于 1.5 mm，需改筒身或改板框</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="60" top="664" width="300" height="26"><Container width="300" height="26" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="19" color="#1B1E22" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">投影与读图说明</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="63.5" top="700.5" width="5" height="5"><Container width="5" height="5" color="#C8552B" borderRadius="2.5"/></Positioned><Positioned left="78" top="692" width="860" height="22"><Container width="860" height="22" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#6A6151" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">等角投影：e1 = (0.87, 0.50) 沿装配轴 · e2 = (-0.87, 0.50) 横向 · e3 = (0, -1) 高度</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="63.5" top="723.5" width="5" height="5"><Container width="5" height="5" color="#C8552B" borderRadius="2.5"/></Positioned><Positioned left="78" top="715" width="860" height="22"><Container width="860" height="22" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#6A6151" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">本服务不支持透视矩阵（探针 01c 实测），轴测体全部由 2D 仿射列向量拼接，圆面用 (e2, e3) 剪切得到椭圆盖</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="63.5" top="746.5" width="5" height="5"><Container width="5" height="5" color="#C8552B" borderRadius="2.5"/></Positioned><Positioned left="78" top="738" width="860" height="22"><Container width="860" height="22" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#6A6151" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">侧面轮廓取 a×Mv 极值的切点连线，端盖椭圆不会被筒壁切齐；序号气泡落在装配轴上</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="60" top="960" width="1480" height="26"><Container width="1480" height="26" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="16" color="#2E5468" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">虚构演示产品：AX-3 手电的零件、材料、工序与评审意见均为演示数据，不代表任何真实在售产品；透视矩阵在本服务不生效，轴测体全部由 2D 仿射基向量拼接。</Text></Container></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>